<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27243" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διόπτρ-α</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>optical instrument</i> for
			measuring angles, altitudes, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Euc.
				<u>Phaen.</u>
				p.10M.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.46.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Attal.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hipparch.
				1.10.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				1.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				5.14
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν δ. θεωρία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gem.
					5.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>aperturesight</i> in a torsion-engine, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				64.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				76.48
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>plate of talc</i> for glazing windows, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.2.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαστολεύς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				16.89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.73
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σημεῖον ἐν θυτικῇ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
